[306119b](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/306119b843f36b80124bf2561b47bb4976a47890))\n* Support Flexible Parsing ([#37](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/37)) ([f7c45aa](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/f7c45aa70429cb111599cd5a257e22a0d336f77e))\n* update getAllMetadata function ([#33](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/33)) ([f6ccbcd](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/f6ccbcd4435e31bf0e562ee676ac32f6fd8c71ee))\n\n### Features\n\n* Add decoration handler for handling fragment decoration ([#39](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/39)) ([5f942a2](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/5f942a20cb6eef69e89eef97879f311198fd39fb))\n* add fragments support ([b59b6a3](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/b59b6a373fa7aec97cfd85548138d61dd2fd1019))\n* add fragments support ([f0cc4ee](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/f0cc4ee047fb1b84f3138e5fb2c30e3b20e0b1b5))\n* add support for custom conversion name for experiments ([d09ce89](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/d09ce895858fe0922578afff2da46c0309ed8a41))\n* add support for experimentation ([07ace43](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/07ace43c6bc17c9a55809ad32151c6ba92f8ee01))\n* add support for experimentation ([453b598](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/453b59880c130e2983d486d2303e9cdbd8fbc733))\n* add support for multiple experiments in the UI ([9ea6ed3](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/9ea6ed3871b20505cf33e6d5b79a64d942fb8e03))\n* Central host UI files ([#40](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/40)) ([9b4478d](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/9b4478da715a84db54bb6e07090d465188375dd0))\n* prepare data for RUMv2 collection ([7dc74e1](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/7dc74e14dd8a39aae6bc5558ff494dc5f1a403cd))\n* support consent management  ([#56](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/56)) ([5b7a1a0](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/5b7a1a09028c556eeaedf1e42c5def0d7441b21d))\n* support customized variant name for fragment variants ([#36](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/36)) ([9db8662](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/9db86622117e4327cec042bfc3b16e73a71a4bec))\n* Support page level full redirection ([#43](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/43)) ([285011f](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/285011f795fa84f0811c7eead2ea6bf3de5b3ae0))\n* Supporting Naming Variants in Page Expereimentation ([#31](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/issues/31)) ([ae769a2](https://github.com/adobe/aem-experimentation/commit/ae769a288340b09af1454174b3655fe4c13109f9))","tree":{"sha":"346b136ac957569bf9a6e778096aca147ae25fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/aem-experimentation/git/trees/346b136ac957569bf9a6e778096aca147ae25fb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/aem-experimentation/git/commits/83f8feff57d07599f361d997fe49eec4405de52c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32174276?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semantic-release-bot","id":32174276,"login":"semantic-release-bot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTc0Mjc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semantic-release-b